From: Christopher Owen <3221756+christopherowen@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 01:50:35 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 821/822] perf(worker): move display scanout carve-out to RM
 nvidiactl and trim UMA overhead

Upstream base: local-inference-lab/vllm 19f2c20ed4d64ae22bd009ceacadd85e2a81e354
with candidate-61 series applied through 0820.

Rationale: Reads display carve-out reservation directly from NVIDIA RM via
/dev/nvidiactl without requiring /dev/dri/card0, trims unnecessary startup UMA/GC
and shm_broadcast overhead, and speeds up direct loader/kernel preparation.

Quality implications: None; display carve-out and direct loader CUDA tests pass.

Tests: pytest -q -p deepseek_models tests/v1/worker/test_display_carveout.py tests/model_executor/model_loader/test_direct_loader_cuda.py

Upstream status: local candidate-61 patch
